WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:07.195
Swift AI: Thanks for calling Sample Electrical. I’m the AI receptionist. What can I help you with?

2
00:00:07.495 --> 00:00:11.287
Sample caller: I’d like a quote to replace eight old lights in our office with LED fittings.

3
00:00:11.627 --> 00:00:17.302
Swift AI: Of course. May I have your name, business name and the full address of the office?

4
00:00:17.602 --> 00:00:23.548
Sample caller: It’s Jamie Lee, at Example Design. We’re at forty Example Road, Sunshine.

5
00:00:23.888 --> 00:00:29.424
Swift AI: Thanks, Jamie. What’s the best phone number for the electrician to call you back?

6
00:00:29.724 --> 00:00:33.894
Sample caller: Zero four nine one, five seven zero, one five seven.

7
00:00:34.234 --> 00:00:43.985
Swift AI: That’s the number ending one five seven. Are the existing lights fluorescent fittings? Is this a routine upgrade or is there a fault?

8
00:00:44.285 --> 00:00:52.204
Sample caller: They’re fluorescent. No faults, we just want brighter lights and lower power use. It’s a single-storey office with a standard ceiling.

9
00:00:52.544 --> 00:00:59.215
Swift AI: Understood. Are you authorised to approve the work, and when could the electrician access the office?

10
00:00:59.515 --> 00:01:06.953
Sample caller: Yes, I’m the office manager. A weekday after four would suit for an inspection. There’s parking behind the building.

11
00:01:07.293 --> 00:01:17.443
Swift AI: I have eight lights at forty Example Road, Sunshine, with access after four. Would you prefer the installation during or outside business hours?

12
00:01:17.743 --> 00:01:24.720
Sample caller: After hours would avoid disturbing the team. Please include that option in the quote, and call me before arranging anything.

13
00:01:25.060 --> 00:01:40.351
Swift AI: Absolutely. I’ll pass on the lighting, access and after-hours preferences. The electrician will call to discuss an inspection and confirm the options, availability and pricing. Thanks, Jamie.
